c=json.loads((r/'tools/game-series.json').read_text());c['bouncemasters']={'name':'Bouncemasters','symbol':'↟','revision':'bouncemasters-v1','package':['game.html','core.js','render.js','game.js'],'category':'Penguin launch arcade','summary':'Timed bat swings · animal bumps · upgrades · endless flight route','controls':'Tap · click · Space · large flight action button','variants':[{'kicker':a,'title':b,'copy':t,'tone':'night'} for a,b,t in [('A BEAR. A BAT. A BRAVE PENGUIN.','One more bounce.','Drop from the ledge, time the bear\'s swing and keep your penguin flying with timed animal bumps.'),('KEEP THE FLIGHT ALIVE','Seals. Walruses. Mammoths.','Collect coins, gems and chests while physics carries you across three original winter regions.'),('YOUR NEXT FLIGHT GOES FURTHER','Power. Speed. Rebound. Beat Force.','Four earned upgrade paths, a cumulative progress map, trophy rewards and a free daily gift.'),('A LITTLE PERSONALITY','Choose your bat. Find your rhythm.','Five distinct bats, four penguin looks, classic or relaxed timing, practice and three downloadable mods.')]],'features':[['Time the swing and the bump','Drop, bat and buffer a tap near a descending animal contact. Actual gravity, momentum, snow rebound and camera tracking.'],['A route with rewards','Three changing biomes, coins/gems/chests, four upgrades, cumulative trophy milestones and once-daily gifts.'],['Make it yours','Original bear, penguin and animal artwork. Earned bats/outfits, big touch input, keyboard, practice and three native mods.']],'mods':[['bouncemoon','Moon Bounce','☾','Lower gravity gives longer airtime. Landing targets still follow the actual trajectory.'],['bouncetreasures','Double Treasures','◇','Coins, gems and chests award twice their ordinary pickup currency.'],['bouncemagnet','Penguin Magnet','U','A larger real collection radius pulls in nearby coins, gems and chests.']]};(r/'tools/game-series.json').write_text(json.dumps(c,indent=2)+'\n')
(d/'README.md').write_text('# Bouncemasters\n\nOriginal PocketVM penguin-launch arcade inspired by the Famobi browser Bouncemasters format linked by the user. Tap to drop, tap near bat height to launch, then time animal bumps while descending. Contact taps are briefly buffered and only boost close to an animal. Momentum, gravity, snow restitution, speed limits and skidding are simulated at 120 Hz. Pads follow the drag-adjusted landing trajectory at every upgrade level. Coins/gems/chests use swept pickup checks. Course objects are removed behind the camera.\n\nThree winter regions rotate endlessly. Four upgrade paths: Power, Max Speed, Rebound and Beat Force; the first Beat Force purchase costs800 coins. Cumulative route distance awards trophy milestones. Daily gift is 150 coins +1 gem once per UTC date. Five cosmetic bats and four outfits are purchased with earned gems. Each preview uses the same drawing as its in-game model. No ads, purchases, online leaderboard or accounts.\n\nTap/click or Space performs the flight action. One big touch button, timing gauge and clear animal-ready cue. Relaxed timing, pause on blur/rotation, reduced particles and synthesized effects. Practice never changes career rewards. Completed earnings and milestones save once; the route map and options remain local.\n\nThree native mods change gravity, pickup amounts or collection radius, with isolated save keys. Offline Store packages embed all JavaScript, verify exact bytes and source-check/sanitize saves. Original art and code. Reference: https://www.crazygames.com/game/bouncemasters.\n')
p=r/'README.md';p.write_text(p.read_text()+'\nBouncemasters adds original polar-bear swings and penguin flights with timed animal bumps, realistic momentum, three endless scenery regions, coins/gems/chests, four earned upgrades, route trophies and five cosmetic bats. Touch/click/Space, relaxed timing, practice, saved progression and three native mods. [Play Bouncemasters](./store/bouncemasters/game.html).\n')
